  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Gérez sans effort le menu de votre restaurant avec Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Mois",
  "/Year": "/Année",
  "Buy Now": "Acheter maintenant",
  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Offres et promotions dynamiques",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Boostez vos ventes et attirez plus de clients grâce à notre fonctionnalité de gestion des offres. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Dispositions de table efficaces",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Optimisez votre espace salle à manger et rationalisez vos opérations grâce à notre fonction de disposition des tables. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Personnalisation et mises à jour en temps réel",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Adaptez votre menu à l'identité unique de votre restaurant grâce à nos outils de création d'attributs et de catégories. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Engagement client amélioré",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Faites passer votre service client au niveau supérieur avec nos outils de gestion client. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Mises à jour du front-end en temps réel",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Avec Dash SaaS, toutes les modifications que vous apportez à votre menu, vos offres ou la disposition de votre table à manger sont instantanément visibles sur le front-end. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Pourquoi choisir des modules dédiés",
  "for your business?": "pour votre entreprise ?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Avec Dash, vous pouvez gérer facilement toutes les fonctions de votre entreprise à partir d'un seul endroit",
  "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Donnez du pouvoir à votre personnel avec DASH",
